ent-CMURuActionQueenSpit = Queen Spit (50/40)
    .desc = Fire a single neurotoxic spit up to 4 tiles or an acid spit up to 5 tiles. Neurotoxin paralyzes for 2 seconds and can be resisted by maximum endurance or neurotoxin immunity. Both types share an 8-second cooldown.
ent-CMURuActionQueenScreech = Screech (250)
    .desc = Paralyze visible enemies within 4 tiles for 2 seconds, and slow and deafen enemies within 6 tiles for 3 seconds. Solid walls block the screech. Cooldown: 50 seconds.
ent-CMURuActionQueenToggleSpit = Toggle Spit Type
    .desc = Switch between neurotoxin (50 plasma, 4 tiles) and acid (40 plasma, 5 tiles). Switching does not reset the spit cooldown.
